<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γά̆ν-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάνος</span>
			, <i>brightness, brilliance</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1484.97
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.48d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>joy, gladness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.335
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>lacker</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστω τὸ γ. τοῦ χαλκοῦ μόλιβδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					6.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. of
			internal <i>membranes</i> or <i>coats</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γ. τῶν ἐντέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Trall.
					9.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sever.
				<u>Clyst.</u>
				p.34D.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
